{
    "$comment": [
        "Merge these keys into the plugin's composer.json; this file is not a composer.json of its own.",
        "Versions are the current releases as of 2026-10-07 (repo.packagist.org).",
        "This is the Unit layer only: Pest 5 and Brain Monkey, with no WordPress. The Integration suite has its own Composer setup in tests/Integration/composer.json, on PHPUnit 9.6, because WordPress' test suite supports PHPUnit 9 only and yoast/phpunit-polyfills cannot install beside PHPUnit 13 (UAMS-Web/uams-claude-skills#124).",
        "config.platform.php is the development PHP, 8.4.1, in every WordPress repository: every PHPUnit 13 release requires php >=8.4.1, so 8.4.0 does not resolve. It is not the supported floor. The floor goes in require.php, the plugin header's Requires PHP, rector.php and phpstan.neon.dist, and a floor lint job parses the shipped files on it (the tests skill).",
        "A plugin with no composer.json gets one holding these keys plus name, description, type and license, and a require block holding only php (the supported floor, which Rector and PHPStan read): development dependencies only, so nothing is installed into production."
    ],
    "require-dev": {
        "brain/monkey": "^2.7",
        "pestphp/pest": "^5.3"
    },
    "config": {
        "platform": {
            "php": "8.4.1"
        },
        "sort-packages": true,
        "allow-plugins": {
            "pestphp/pest-plugin": true
        }
    },
    "scripts": {
        "setup:integration": "@composer install --working-dir=tests/Integration",
        "test": [
            "@test:unit",
            "@test:integration"
        ],
        "test:unit": "pest",
        "test:integration": "@php tests/Integration/vendor/bin/phpunit --configuration tests/Integration/phpunit.xml"
    },
    "scripts-descriptions": {
        "setup:integration": "Install the Integration suite's own Composer setup (PHPUnit 9.6, wp-phpunit, the polyfills).",
        "test": "Run both suites, each in its own process, so the Unit suite never sees WordPress.",
        "test:unit": "Run the Pest suite that needs no WordPress and no database.",
        "test:integration": "Run the PHPUnit 9.6 suite that boots WordPress through wp-phpunit against the test database."
    }
}
